From: Codex <codex@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] comctl32: place themed check box and group box labels like XP in the XP shell

Purpose: line up the XP shell's dialog labels with XP's.
XP behavior: check box and radio button labels start at the box and
half-digit offset; a group box draws its frame line at half the text height
and insets its caption by 8 pixels.
Wine before: added its one-pixel default text margin after the offset, and
drew the group frame a pixel higher and its caption a pixel left.
Change: the same as XP, in win4wine-controls.dll only.
Evidence: the radio buttons, group frames and labels of Folder Options
equal the reference XP machine's.
Scope: only with WIN4WINE_EXTERNAL_SHELL and the controls module.
Old patches: 0069.
---
 dlls/comctl32_v6/button.c | 11 +++++++++--
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dlls/comctl32_v6/button.c b/dlls/comctl32_v6/button.c
index 87c594c..aa166bf 100644
--- a/dlls/comctl32_v6/button.c
+++ b/dlls/comctl32_v6/button.c
@@ -2955,6 +2955,11 @@ static void CB_ThemedPaint(HTHEME theme, const BUTTON_INFO *infoPtr, HDC hDC, in
         label_rect.right -= box_size.cx + text_offset;
     else
         label_rect.left += box_size.cx + text_offset;
+    /* XP starts the label at the offset itself; the label's one pixel text
+     * margin below would put it a pixel further right. Measured in the XP
+     * shell's Folder Options. */
+    if (COMCTL32_IsExternalAlias() && !(dwStyle & BS_LEFTTEXT || ex_style & WS_EX_RIGHT))
+        label_rect.left--;
 
     old_label_rect = label_rect;
     dtFlags = BUTTON_CalcLayoutRects(infoPtr, hDC, &label_rect, &image_rect, &text_rect);
@@ -3057,10 +3062,12 @@ static void GB_ThemedPaint(HTHEME theme, const BUTTON_INFO *infoPtr, HDC hDC, in
 
     bgRect = clientRect;
     GetTextMetricsW(hDC, &textMetric);
-    bgRect.top += (textMetric.tmHeight / 2) - 1;
+    /* XP draws the frame's top line a pixel lower and starts the caption a
+     * pixel further right, as measured in the XP shell's Folder Options. */
+    bgRect.top += (textMetric.tmHeight / 2) - (COMCTL32_IsExternalAlias() ? 0 : 1);
 
     labelRect = clientRect;
-    InflateRect(&labelRect, -7, 1);
+    InflateRect(&labelRect, COMCTL32_IsExternalAlias() ? -8 : -7, 1);
     dtFlags = BUTTON_CalcLayoutRects(infoPtr, hDC, &labelRect, &imageRect, &textRect);
     if (dtFlags != (UINT)-1 && !show_image_only(infoPtr))
     {
